          "description": "Get token balances for a wallet address. By default fetches across all supported chains. Pass chainIds for a partial refresh — only the specified chains are queried, which is faster and useful after a swap when you only need updated balances for the source and destination chains. Returns balances, USD prices, total portfolio value, and categorized positions (tokens, collateral, debt, vaults). walletAddress is optional when WALLET_PRIVATE_KEY is set in the environment.",
